<%-- Chân trang và script dùng chung. Trang gọi tự đóng </body></html> sau khi thêm script riêng (nếu có). --%>
  <footer class="site-footer border-top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-6 mb-5 mb-lg-0">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-12">
              <h3 class="footer-heading mb-4">Điều hướng</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li><a href="${ctx}/">Trang chủ</a></li>
                <li><a href="${ctx}/shop">Cửa hàng</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <c:choose>
                  <c:when test="${sessionScope.auth.customer}">
                    <li><a href="${ctx}/account/profile">Tài khoản</a></li>
                    <li><a href="${ctx}/orders">Đơn hàng của tôi</a></li>
                    <li><a href="${ctx}/wishlist">Yêu thích</a></li>
                  </c:when>
                  <c:when test="${empty sessionScope.auth}">
                    <li><a href="${ctx}/login">Đăng nhập</a></li>
                    <li><a href="${ctx}/register">Đăng ký</a></li>
                  </c:when>
                </c:choose>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
          <h3 class="footer-heading mb-4">Mua sắm dễ dàng</h3>
          <p>Phí giao hàng 20.000 ₫ mỗi đơn. Thanh toán khi nhận hàng hoặc qua VNPAY. Trả hàng trong 15 ngày kể từ khi nhận.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="block-5 mb-5">
            <h3 class="footer-heading mb-4">Thông tin liên hệ</h3>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
              <li class="address">1 Võ Văn Ngân, Phường Thủ Đức, TP. Hồ Chí Minh</li>
              <li class="phone"><a href="tel:19001234">1900 1234</a></li>
              <li class="email">hotro@shoppers.vn</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row pt-5 mt-5 text-center">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <p>
            Copyright &copy; 2026 Shoppers &mdash; Clothing Shop E-Commerce (Java Servlet/JSP).
            <!-- Link back to Colorlib can't be removed. Template is licensed under CC BY 3.0. -->
            Template made with <i class="icon-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i> by
            <a href="https://colorlib.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary">Colorlib</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/jquery-3.3.1.min.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/jquery-ui.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/popper.min.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/owl.carousel.min.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/jquery.magnific-popup.min.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/aos.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/assets/js/main.js"></script>
